id: natural-dragon
name: Natural Dragon
order: 7
optionOf: personified-dragon-ball
optionEffect: 6
description: >
  While you are in your Ball Form, you also have access to the Absorb Maneuver. Additionally, increase your Combat Rolls by 1(T) while you possess at least 1 stack of the Absorption Awakening. Upon gaining a stack of the Absorption Awakening, immediately leave your Ball Form and return to normal.
text: >
